## TRAINING ASSISTANCE

- Assistance will be required as follows:

- 1x Standards staff for monitoring during Critical ECs/PCs, aperiodic classroom reviews, and instructor evaluations; and

- 1x TDO for monitoring during Critical ECs/PCs, aperiodic classroom reviews, and instructor evaluations.

	Remarks: 1 x network support staff for assistance during labs and for virtual environment support and sustainment is required, but currently unstaffed.

