| 006.02.02 Review terminal commands | Review terminal commands to interact with workstation to include, but not limited to:  user commands;  file navigations;  file manipulation;  file parsing; and  misc. | Interactive Lecture/ Practical Exercises/Labs | 6 x 50 mins |  |
| 006.02.03 Analyze DND network devices in network traffic | Analyze DND network devices by observing behaviour traversing the network. This can include:  isolating traffic  pattern analysis  etc.  Identify DND network devices by utilizing the following tools observe network devices in network traffic:  tshark;  wireshark;  CyberChef; and  zeek/bro. | Guided Discussion/ Practical Exercises/Labs | 32 x 50 mins |  |

PO 007 Analyze Malicious Activity in Network Traffic

EO 007.01 Triage IDS Alerts

- Performance: Triage IDS alerts.

- Conditions:

- given:

- supervision;

