| 007.02.05 Identify post-exploitation techniques | Identify post-exploitation techniques to include: data exfiltration; C2; remote administration; common persistence mechanisms; lateral movement; and etc. | Interactive lecture Demonstration Practical Exercises | 8 x 50 mins |  |

