| **Dates** | 13-24 Feb 2017 |
| **Board Composition** |
|  | Surname | Initials | Rank | Unit |
| Co-Chair (content) | Nucci | C | Cdr | CFD, Ottawa |
| Co-Chair (process) | Gillan | D | Maj | CFD, Ottawa |
